  "prefLabel": "Plc 1107.01 Certification Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1107.01 Certification Required. An applicant for an initial or renewal license under RSA 328‑H and Plc 1100 shall have the specified certification from the applicable certifying organization listed in Plc 1107.02, provided that an applicant having certification from a certifying organization not listed in Plc 1107.02 may request a waiver under Plc 211 to have the certification accepted based on a combination of education, certification by the alternate organization, and experience.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1100.html"
